    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "intro_heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "A trade programme for considered interiors"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "intro_body",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Whether you are an interior designer, architect, hotelier, stylist or property developer, William Wood Trade gives you access to preferential pricing, dedicated support and a refined collection of mirrors, furniture and homeware.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Editorial split one"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "split1_image",
      "label": "Image"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "split1_eyebrow",
      "label": "Eyebrow",
      "default": "The collection"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "split1_heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "Pieces selected with your projects in mind"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "split1_body",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>From statement mirrors to furniture and accessories, our range is curated to support complete schemes and styling moments across homes, hospitality spaces and commercial projects.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Editorial split two"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "split2_image",
      "label": "Image"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "split2_eyebrow",
      "label": "Eyebrow",
      "default": "Support"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "split2_heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "A dedicated team from brief to delivery"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "split2_body",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Our trade team can help with product guidance, availability, lead times and order support, so you can keep each project moving with clarity.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Steps"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "steps_eyebrow",
      "label": "Eyebrow",
      "default": "How it works"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "steps_heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "Applying for an account"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "steps_body",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Complete the application form and our trade team will review your details before getting in touch.</p>"
